# Build mode for the browser test suite: `vite build --mode harness`.
#
# Committed on purpose. It is loaded ONLY for `--mode harness`, never by a default or
# production build, which is what keeps the unauthenticated harness route out of the shipped
# bundle. tests/unit/harness-excluded.test.ts builds in the default mode and proves it.
#
# Never put this variable in .env, .env.local or .env.production. That same test fails if
# anyone does.
VITE_TEST_HARNESS=1
